Credits
-------
The adjudicator's test suite is specified by the Diplomacy Adjudicator Test
Cases (DATC) by Lucas B. Kruijswijk. The scenarios are encoded as original
test fixtures; apart from the one reference copy named above, no text from
that document is reproduced here.

The adjudication approach follows Lucas B. Kruijswijk's "The Math of
Adjudication".
